      "title": "Q2 Seller Operations Review — Apr 29 — AI Notetaker Summary",
      "content": "AI Notetaker — meeting summary\nMeeting:  Q2 Seller Operations Review — Apr 29\nHost:     Keisha Morgan\nDuration: 14:00 – 15:30 PT (90 min)\nAttendees (full window): Keisha Morgan, Tomás Rivera, Grace Okafor, Daniel Brooks\nAttendees (partial, left at 14:35 for partner call): Jordan Pike, Mei Tanaka\n\n— Assortment & listings —\n• Lumen & Loom adding 14 SKUs for June (outdoor lighting line); Kestrel Outdoor adding 9 (camp cookware refresh). Daniel to stage listings by May 8.\n• Listing-content fixes: 6 Lumen & Loom listings missing dimension attributes; 3 Kestrel listings with outdated hero images. Brand reps to supply assets by Friday.\n• June promo calendar reviewed: Memorial Day event anchors week 4; both brands confirmed participation and funding.\n• Inbound ASN timing: Lumen & Loom shipment arrives May 6, Kestrel May 11; Tomás flagged dock capacity is tight the week of May 11.\n\n— Logistics FYI —\n• Swiftline Parcel carrier talks ongoing; more next week.\n• Ops all-hands moved to next Tuesday.\n• Q2 seller scorecard recommendations due to Renee by May 30; partners get decisions through the official partner portal notice in early June.\n• Returns-portal redesign: no decision yet; more after Thursday exec sync.\n• May weekend coverage rotation: Tomás week 1, Grace week 2, Daniel week 3, week 4 TBD (asking vendor ops).\n• Apr 18 warehouse-scanner outage retro: Tomás owns handheld firmware rollback; Grace owns escalation macro update; Daniel owns runbook update — target end of next week.\n\n— Customer order escalations (internal portion) —\n• Order HG-4418207 (Linda Ferreira): Swiftline delivery 6 days late; refund shipping plus $25 goodwill credit approved. Grace to close the case.\n• Order HG-4420913 (Marcus Delgado, 1187 Alder Crest Rd, Tacoma WA): marked delivered, customer reports never received; probable misdelivery. Tomás to file the Swiftline trace and reship with signature required.\n• Order HG-4409552 (Samantha Yu): third high-value re